      "writtenOn": "2023-07-12T20:53:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Each target uses one single config, so in order to support multiple configs we need multiple targets with different names. This specific target uses the `8888` config, but a different target might use e.g. `gles`, as is the case in the follow-up CL.\n\nAs an example, see the list comprehension between lines 512 and 538, which generates targets `cpu_8888_android_test` and `cpu_565_android_test`.",
      "parentUuid": "6d141f96_ed1d50d0",
